ass=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, by traveling around the map by riding the food truck, players gather unique recipes and ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted cooking stations are strategically placed to combine ingredients and complete recipes into finished dishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose which dishes to sell, serve food according to NPC requests, and earn gold.</p></li></ul>",
